@testray.main.component.name = "Support QA"
@type = "apis"

Feature: Liferay Support APIs
	Testing to assure that major API fields for Liferay Support sites are correct

Scenario: Okta User API fields
    Testing to assure OKTA User API fields are correct

    * the following okta user json fields and their respective quantities should be present
    | id                             | 2  |
